{
  "title": "DataSync / Snow Family · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "옮길 대상과 중단 허용 시간에 맞춰 데이터·서버 이전 방식을 선택합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>DataSync / Snow Family</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#guide-1\">이전 대상별 도구 선택</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#guide-2\">안전하게 전환하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>11 / 62</span></div><h1>DataSync / Snow Family</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS 마이그레이션은 <strong>기존 서버와 데이터를 AWS 환경으로 옮기는 작업</strong>입니다. 파일을 복사하는지, 데이터베이스의 변경을 계속 반영하는지, 서버 전체를 이전하는지에 따라 도구를 선택합니다.</p><p>전송 자체보다 전환 후 애플리케이션이 정상 동작하는지가 중요합니다. 용량, 네트워크, 허용 중단 시간, 검증과 되돌릴 방법을 먼저 정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-datasync\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"agent-location-and-task\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"basic-and-enhanced-mode\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"verification-and-cutover\"></span><h2>이전 대상별 도구 선택</h2><p><strong>DataSync</strong>는 파일·객체 데이터를 네트워크로 옮기는 작업을 자동화합니다. 원본과 대상 연결을 준비하고 전송·검증 작업을 구성합니다.</p><p><strong>DMS</strong>는 데이터베이스의 초기 데이터와 지속 변경 복제<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 이전할 때 사용합니다. 엔진을 바꾼다면 스키마와 애플리케이션의 호환성도 별도로 검토합니다.</p><p><strong>Application Migration Service(MGN)</strong>는 서버를 복제해 AWS에서 실행하고 테스트·전환하는 데 사용합니다. 이전 후에도 운영체제와 애플리케이션 설정을 검증합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snowball-edge\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snowcone-and-snowmobile\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-data-transfer-terminal\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"transfer-family-and-database-migration-service\"></span><h2>안전하게 전환하기</h2><p>먼저 초기 데이터를 옮기고 변경분을 따라잡은 뒤, 정한 시점에 쓰기와 연결을 새 환경으로 전환합니다. 데이터량과 네트워크 속도로 소요 시간을 예측합니다.</p><p>행 수나 파일 무결성, 권한, 성능, 백업을 확인합니다. 문제가 생겼을 때 어떤 환경을 기준으로 복구할지와 전환 후 변경 데이터를 어떻게 처리할지도 계획합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>마이그레이션의 진행</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>분석·준비</strong><span>대상·중단 시간·도구</span></li><li><strong>복제·검증</strong><span>초기 데이터와 변경분</span></li><li><strong>전환</strong><span>연결과 쓰기 대상 변경</span></li><li><strong>운영 확인</strong><span>성능·백업·원복 판단</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">데이터 복사 완료와 서비스 이전 완료를 구분해 확인합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>운영 DB를 옮길 때 DMS로 초기 데이터를 적재하고 변경분을 복제합니다. 검증 후 짧은 쓰기 중단 시간에 연결을 새 DB로 전환합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>지속 변경 복제</strong> — 초기 데이터 이후 발생한 변경을 계속 추적해 대상에 반영하는 방식입니다. 데이터베이스 이전에서는 CDC라는 용어를 사용합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/datasync/latest/userguide/what-is-datasync.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS DataSync? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/snowball/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Snowball | Secure Edge Computing and Offline Data Transfer ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/data-transfer-terminal/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">On-demand data transfer – AWS Data Transfer Terminal -- AWS ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q050\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q051\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q051\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q051</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q051/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An existing Snowball Edge customer must import hundreds of terabytes to S3, but the available network link is too slow. Which option uses physically shipped devices?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snowball Edge Storage Optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 기존 고객은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#storage-optimized\">Storage Optimized</a> 장치를 배송받아 데이터를 복사하고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 반송해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 가져올 수 있다. 신규 고객에게는 장치 주문이 제공되지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q101\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q101\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q101</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q101/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An existing Snowball Edge customer operates a remote factory with intermittent connectivity and must analyze video locally before transferring results to AWS. Which device configuration is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync over a continuous network connection</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge Compute Optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#compute-optimized\">Compute Optimized</a>는 연결이 제한된 현장에서 로컬 컴퓨팅을 수행하고 이후 데이터를 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 옮기는 기존 고객의 용도에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q102\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q102\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q102</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q102/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which statement best distinguishes Snowball Edge from AWS DataSync for an existing customer?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both services require a continuously available high-bandwidth internet link</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge can provide local compute and physically transport data, while DataSync moves data over a network</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DataSync ships encrypted appliances, while Snowball Edge is a software agent</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Neither service can move data to Amazon S3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a>는 물리 장치로 데이터 운송과 현장 컴퓨팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 네트워크를 통한 온라인 전송 서비스다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q103\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q103\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q103</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q103/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">As of September 2026, a new AWS customer needs an offline physical-transfer solution for a large data migration. Which statement is accurate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The customer should order a new Snowball Edge device without restrictions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront provides physical device shipping</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway endpoint is a physical-transfer device</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge is unavailable to new customers; evaluate AWS Data Transfer Terminal or partner solutions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a>를 신규 고객에게 제공하지 않는다. 현재 물리 전송 대안으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-data-transfer-terminal\">AWS Data Transfer Terminal</a> 또는 파트너 솔루션을 안내한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">이전 용어 <b>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">다음 용어 <b>DynamoDB</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
